{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112038788642004993"]}, "author_id": "2111682788479143937", "created_at": "2026-10-20T03:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112385820640292864"], "id": "2112385820640292864", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "শ্রীভূমি থেকে তেলিপুকুর, ৮টা পুজো হেঁটেই\nBidhannagar Road station to Telipukur on foot: Sreebhumi, Lake Town, five Dum Dum Park pujas, ending at Telipukur Yuba Sangha. 8 pujas, 8.0 km.\nhttps://t.co/uZBTmNj6oW\n#DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/7LIUnwBK85", "url": "https://x.com/moodkolkata/status/2112385820640292864"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112352400594075648", "13_2112352414254944256", "3_2112352477156970496", "3_2112352492717809664"]}, "author_id": "1521913806976217088", "created_at": "2026-10-20T01:17:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112352506609381471"], "id": "2112352506609381471", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 194, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "This is Santosh Mitra Square right now, and it looks absolutely amazing! 🤩❤️ The pandal theme is Vande Mataram 🇮🇳🔥\n#DurgaNavami #durgamaa https://t.co/ntnKfh5cpz", "url": "https://x.com/ManishS50138869/status/2112352506609381471"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112341439858290688"]}, "author_id": "1950859717984600065", "created_at": "2026-10-20T00:33:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112341522809053664"], "id": "2112341522809053664", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Huge crowds have gathered at Durga Puja pandals across Kolkata for Maha Navami. Devotees flocked to the Kendua Shanti Sangha pandal to offer prayers to Goddess Durga, seeking her blessings for peace and prosperity on the ninth day of Navratri. #DurgaPuja #Kolkata #MahaNavami https://t.co/ys5S7y0ej9", "url": "https://x.com/ManshiSoni98680/status/2112341522809053664"}, {"author_id": "1674681718895411201", "created_at": "2026-10-19T22:00:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112302797412864254"], "id": "2112302797412864254", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1923903962", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 205, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112271189909631253", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@NeelanjanSircar You have to appreciate the depth of stupidity here- they had the perfectly fine Santosh Mitra Sq and also so many new clubs but they chose to make Park Street their flagship pujo because it’s associated with Christmas. The pettiness of it.", "url": "https://x.com/reindeerdodo89/status/2112302797412864254"}, {"author_id": "1312386045531615240", "created_at": "2026-10-19T20:07:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112274424749822094"], "id": "2112274424749822094", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 214, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112187036476293596", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "what a terrible fucking night, firstly, the police diverted the path to santosh mitra pandal through A RED LIGHT AREA during peak business hours 😭😭\nalso a bihari guy tried to steal my phone from my pocket bruh 😭 can netanyahu nuke central calcutta I'm so fucking serious!! https://t.co/nM0HB6EqtX", "url": "https://x.com/chickenalakiev/status/2112274424749822094"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-19T20:00:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112272580870549643"], "id": "2112272580870549643", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2095097050786676736", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112272390411669812", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@TheFusionProj @LancerFlying Chetla Agrani was long tied to TMC leader Firhad Hakim as organizer-in-chief. Tridhara Sammilani was known as former TMC MLA Debasish Kumar’s puja. Ballygunge Cultural Association lacks similar documented TMC political patronage in reports. The claim holds for two of the three.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2112272580870549643"}, {"author_id": "2732391594", "created_at": "2026-10-19T19:20:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112262715762978959"], "id": "2112262715762978959", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 445, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Kolkata’s Santosh Mitra Square Durga Puja gets Bengal govt’s ‘Best of the Best’ award.\n\nThe main organiser of the Santosh Mitra Square puja is BJP MLA Sajal Ghosh.", "url": "https://x.com/ViratHindu1992/status/2112262715762978959"}, {"author_id": "1674681718895411201", "created_at": "2026-10-19T19:13:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112260926342865298"], "id": "2112260926342865298", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1775544741788299264", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112260135779545371", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@amit_swing_trd @goonereol Govt aid money cut has had a major impact. It was finally announced 20 days before pujo and work is budgeted in may itself( April if no election). \n\nParty support was also very poor. They didn’t even give extra money to their own Santosh Mitra square. It’s political.", "url": "https://x.com/reindeerdodo89/status/2112260926342865298"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112256522093031424", "3_2112256536190099456", "3_2112256552191369217", "3_2112256574727262208"]}, "author_id": "3790120694", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:56:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112256610886402285"], "id": "2112256610886402285", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 66, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🌺 Celebrating Tradition, Embracing Togetherness! 🌺\n\nSribhumi Police celebrated the spirit of Durga Puja with a traditional cultural programme at the Police Reserve, keeping alive the rich heritage and festive spirit of Maa Durga. 🙏\n\n@CMOfficeAssam @assampolice @DGPAssamPolice https://t.co/pDz0DWTEZ2", "url": "https://x.com/sribhumipolice/status/2112256610886402285"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112249016528539648"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:26:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112249040251637894"], "id": "2112249040251637894", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 3855, "like_count": 88, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 16}, "text": "Chaltabagan at 11:52PM. No crowd or ad banners.\n\nHome to three iconic Durga Pujas (Lohapatty, Sarbojanin, Simla).\n\nClose to Hatibagan Nabin Pally, Kashi Bose, Nalin Sarkar, College Square, Santosh Mitra, Shyambazar &amp; Sealdah Station.\n\nPUJA VIBES ARE MISSING BECAUSE OF BJP! https://t.co/ZKD7yShUNJ", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2112249040251637894"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112247494948376576", "3_2112247598010839040"]}, "author_id": "1098908357132464128", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:20:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112247612514644235"], "id": "2112247612514644235", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 10326, "like_count": 73, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Sribhumi 11:30 pm, what's up with this sudden crowd on Ashtami/Nabami??\n\nI thought there is not much crowd for this pandal. https://t.co/y46GBrro7z", "url": "https://x.com/lofITechie/status/2112247612514644235"}, {"author_id": "1881755350912864256", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:12:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112245614683787350"], "id": "2112245614683787350", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2026 Devi Durga Samman Awards, with BJP MLA-associated Santosh Mitra Square winning ‘Serar Sera’. \n\nWatch; https://t.co/d947t1pRR7\n\nDurga Puja deserves celebration, but public awards demand transparent judging, published criteria and disclosed scores.", "url": "https://x.com/AsishManna_/status/2112245614683787350"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112244042524393472", "3_2112244069774786560", "3_2112244091895554048", "3_2112244110358917121"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:06:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112244134006358113"], "id": "2112244134006358113", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 606, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2108533573976506750", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "📍 Haridevpur 41 Pally.\n\n🎨 Gouranga Kuila.\n\n🌟 The pandal is made using wasted hardware.\n\n👉 SO, SO, SO STUNNING! This legendary artist is known for using waste materials for creating pandals. He did both 41 Pally &amp; Tridhara Akalbodhan in 2025 &amp; 2026.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/BsZKZLqBFp https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2112244134006358113"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112221956900884480", "3_2112221971060752384", "3_2112221986273550336", "3_2112222001687678976"]}, "author_id": "1794095386228899841", "created_at": "2026-10-19T16:39:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112222011825209741"], "id": "2112222011825209741", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Tridhara Sammilani (Tridhara Akalbodhon) 2026 \n\nTheme: Surasur (সুর-অসুর) — The Eternal Conflict, conceptualised by award-winning artist Gauranga Kuila, with a landmark installation by eco-artist Chandra Nath Saha (Tilak). My personal favourite pandal !!\n\n#DurgaPuja2026 #Kolkata https://t.co/T3ZfuAi5DO", "url": "https://x.com/Light6082/status/2112222011825209741"}, {"author_id": "2051287114319581185", "created_at": "2026-10-19T14:53:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112195411993915673"], "id": "2112195411993915673", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#santosh_mitra_Square \nKolkata\n\nMaha Faltu Management \nMai Pandal dekh kr within 1Km me apna return destination pr pahoch skta tha but Santosh Mitra Square k management ne raste me aise idhar udhar se ghumaya h ki mjhe 10km walk krna pada rha h...intenation is only harrasment", "url": "https://x.com/Siddhant_mad/status/2112195411993915673"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112174526960427008"]}, "author_id": "141584822", "created_at": "2026-10-19T13:42:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112177593713902026"], "id": "2112177593713902026", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1265, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Kolkata, West Bengal: Kolkata’s Santosh Mitra Square Durga Puja pandal is witnessing heavy footfall, prompting authorities to deploy an AI-powered crowd management system following the Chorbagan incident. Senior police officers, personnel and volunteers are monitoring crowds and https://t.co/kRzpCcIbnN", "url": "https://x.com/ians_india/status/2112177593713902026"}, {"author_id": "1430724718676434950", "created_at": "2026-10-19T13:12:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112170016737214690"], "id": "2112170016737214690", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 7398, "like_count": 905, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 84}, "text": "Kolkata’s Santosh Mitra Square Durga Puja gets Bengal govt’s ‘Best of the Best’ award.\n\nThe main organiser of the Santosh Mitra Square puja is BJP MLA Sajal Ghosh.", "url": "https://x.com/NewsArenaIndia/status/2112170016737214690"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112166204815368192"]}, "author_id": "1100927498", "created_at": "2026-10-19T12:58:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112166500576731362"], "id": "2112166500576731362", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3290, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Every Pandal Tells a Story Beyond Celebration\n\nKolkata's Durga Puja 2026 brings together artistic brilliance, devotion and powerful social commentary.\n\nFrom Santosh Mitra Square and Shyambazar Sadanga to Salt Lake FD Block, the city's pandals go beyond visual grandeur, reflecting https://t.co/FJypYvROHB", "url": "https://x.com/DDNewslive/status/2112166500576731362"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112150405941706752"]}, "author_id": "2264849412", "created_at": "2026-10-19T11:58:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112151297696952437"], "id": "2112151297696952437", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 117, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Pentonic turned around 13,000 recycled-plastic pens and 13,000 refills into a 5.5-foot Durga installation at Kolkata’s Tridhara Sammilani.\n\nBut the smarter part comes after the festival.\n\nInstead of being immersed, the installation will be dismantled and the material recycled https://t.co/uVfOkjsXXP", "url": "https://x.com/LogicalIndians/status/2112151297696952437"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112139339476209665", "3_2112139363752738816", "3_2112139392005570560"]}, "author_id": "2084548793731895296", "created_at": "2026-10-19T11:10:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112139419637645374"], "id": "2112139419637645374", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Tridhara Sammilani, on Monoharpukur Road in South Kolkata, was founded in 1947. It began with about 15 to 20 members, and the pujo was a homely affair. The club celebrated its 78th year in 2024. https://t.co/QSL8qQ1R6C", "url": "https://x.com/AhanaGhosh27197/status/2112139419637645374"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112130626350624768", "3_2112130647108329472", "3_2112130663025709056", "3_2112130677307330560"]}, "author_id": "596545730", "created_at": "2026-10-19T10:36:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112130693405048957"], "id": "2112130693405048957", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "#DurgaPuja2026 🙏🙏 The GREATEST FESTIVAL FOR ALL BENGALIS LIKE ME 🙏 some NICE PUJO PANDELS OF SOUTH KOLKATA \"TRIDHARA SAMMILANI\", \"DESHOPRIYO PARK\" 🙏 NOT INTENDED TO VIOLATE ANY COPYRIGHT ©️, CONSENT OR OTHER ISSUES 🙏 https://t.co/hmv9Qut4iI", "url": "https://x.com/satadrumajumder/status/2112130693405048957"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112037986997334016"]}, "author_id": "2111682788479143937", "created_at": "2026-10-19T10:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112129130208584007"], "id": "2112129130208584007", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "কসবা থেকে গড়িয়াহাট, ৭টা পুজো হেঁটেই\nRajdanga (Kasba) to Gariahat on foot: Bosepukur Talbagan and Sitala Mandir, then Ekdalia Evergreen, Singhi Park, Hindustan Club and Hindusthan Park. 7 pujas, 5.1 km.\nhttps://t.co/YpTFwnCKRE\n#DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/MxMkIXC8G9", "url": "https://x.com/moodkolkata/status/2112129130208584007"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112120448423182337"]}, "author_id": "1972555012275650560", "created_at": "2026-10-19T10:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112129129931808885"], "id": "2112129129931808885", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Kolkata celebrates Maha Ashtami at Kendua Shanti Durga Puja pandal as thousands offer prayers.\n\n#MahaAshtami #DurgaPuja #Kolkata #KenduaShanti https://t.co/fz9xwOwBdU", "url": "https://x.com/Newseisamay/status/2112129129931808885"}, {"author_id": "995328305279549440", "created_at": "2026-10-19T10:26:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112128344032714977"], "id": "2112128344032714977", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 26, "impression_count": 11166, "like_count": 123, "quote_count": 10, "reply_count": 33, "retweet_count": 20}, "text": "Two Muslim women I know, one wearing a hijab and the other a niqab, went to visit Sreebhumi Durga Puja, with VIP parking arranged for their car. Instead of being welcomed, club members allegedly told them: “Don't come wearing a hijab. You are Muslim Puja is not for you. Go back.\"", "url": "https://x.com/RadhikaBarman5/status/2112128344032714977"}, {"author_id": "570146526", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:50:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112104137873932795"], "id": "2112104137873932795", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Things that need to be addressed-\nAllow VIP passes,No need to ban them.\nTraffic mgmt- last evening visited ballygunj cultural,samajsevi sangha,exit was on sarat bose rd side. To visit Tridhara on opp side police didn't allow to cross. Said we need 2 walk till lake mall. Absurd", "url": "https://x.com/NetNetizen/status/2112104137873932795"}], "includes": {"media": [{"height": 1920, "media_key": "13_2112038788642004993", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2112038788642004993/img/LnLORC7KLgqf51Wu.jpg", "type": "video", "width": 1080}, {"height": 4096, "media_key": "3_2112352400594075648", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVCVUQ3agAAgXB9.jpg", "width": 30